Package: v2engine
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.72), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.6), pkexec, polkitd, iproute2, nftables, curl
Maintainer: Ali Ranjbar <info@aliranjbar.me>
Description: Lightweight native system proxy client
 V2Engine provides a GTK4 interface for VLESS, VMess, Trojan,
 Shadowsocks, and SSH connections using a bundled sing-box core.
